{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31144","headline":"褒城驿有故元相公旧题诗因仰叹而作 · 薛能","name":"褒城驿有故元相公旧题诗因仰叹而作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鄂相顷题应好池，题云万竹与千棃。\n我来已变当初地，前过应无继此诗。\n敢叹临行殊旧境，惟愁後事劣今时。\n闲吟四壁堪搔首，频见青苹白鹭鸶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}